The files in proto/definitions/ are the Hypersnap protocol definitions,
taken from https://github.com/farcasterorg/hypersnap (GPL-3.0). Those
definitions descend from the Snapchain protocol published by
https://github.com/farcasterxyz/snapchain under the MIT license.

This repository distributes them under GPL-3.0-only, the same license as
Hypersnap, which the MIT license permits. See the repository LICENSE and
the README license section.
